1
00:00:07,115 --> 00:00:09,671
So… you really haven't done anything like that?
I could teach you, you know.

2
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:11,879
I can help.

3
00:00:19,439 --> 00:00:21,164
Stuff like this…
I'm pretty good at.

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,370
I can help… really.

5
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:34,599
Want me to show you?

6
00:00:45,649 --> 00:00:48,243
Why can't I get Frame out of my head?

7
00:00:48,243 --> 00:00:50,431
Maybe I should just… face it.

8
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,865
Hi.

9
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,900
(Top or Bottom)

10
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,699
I'm usually the quiet type…
but I want to try.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,300
(Shall we meet up?)

12
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:09,790
Where are you?

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,500
(I'm driving home,
but I can come see you.)

14
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,500
(Where do I find you?)

15
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:18,099
Should we meet at the CBA hotel?

16
00:01:18,099 --> 00:01:19,864
What are you wearing?

17
00:01:19,864 --> 00:01:22,196
I'm in my school uniform.
Black pants.

18
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:23,720
(I wearing hoodies
and soccer shorts.)

19
00:01:23,744 --> 00:01:25,744
(What's your name?)

20
00:01:26,119 --> 00:01:29,116
I'm Book. And you?
